["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Make Better Decisions by Fixing Yourself First CGM Robux MCP Lua\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-knowledge-先修代谢再谈决策-roblox-创始人反常识管理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e77873607703d33-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>生酮逆转儿子双相后，Roblox 创始人把决策拆成四层</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">David Baszucki 把 Roblox 的决策操作系统拆成四层：身体代谢状态决定重大判断，长期视角乘以快速迭代，通用系统优于硬编码，以及旧模式失效时直接换一整套新经济系统。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">决策</span><span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Child custody through divorce: Navigating the courts and building a custody schedule that works with Michael Fried OurFamilyWizard collaborative law parent coordinator change of circumstances forensic psychologist best interest of the child\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-secureattach-法院已默认五五开-赢家心态才是真正的输/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">52:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>离婚监护权：法院已默认五五开，赢家心态才是真输家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">纽约离婚律师用十年趋势告诉你：法院已从「证明单方监护」转向「为什么不是五五开」；真正决定孩子好坏的，不是时间表，而是父母能否把孩子需求放在自己的痛苦前面。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">离婚</span><span class=\"tag\">儿童监护</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"493 追忆历史学家亚当·麦基翁：华人移民与现代边境制度的形成 indentured labor Natal model 加拿大原则\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-cn2aa250-华人劳工塑造了美国海关-现代边控源自排华法案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>华人劳工塑造了美国海关：现代边控源自排华法案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">海关、签证与护照制度并非欧美内生的发明，而是19世纪末华人移民涌入美国后，为甄别与排斥而催生。合法移民艰难、非法移民容易的吊诡，到今天仍在延续。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麦基翁</span><span class=\"tag\">移民史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ben Thompson on Big Tech, China, and the AI Boom Running Out of Money - [Invest Like the Best, EP.487] reluctant accelerationist NeoCloud hyperscaler token efficiency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-ilt-美国赢下-ai-竞赛反而更危险-中国的最优解是炸掉-tsmc/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/95cf973ef8d0bef7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>美国赢下 AI 竞赛反而更危险：中国的最优解是炸掉 TSMC</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果美国在 AI 上取得压倒性优势，中国的博弈论最优解是炸掉 TSMC。硅谷不愿承认美国对中国供应链的依赖被严重低估，而这种依赖不会在冲突之外被修复。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"285: ENCORE: How Do I Help My Kid Develop a Work Ethic? work ethic intrinsic vs extrinsic motivation warmth and structure complain but comply purpose nagging\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-asklisa-孩子不爱干活不用治-结构与后果比热爱更有效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ace27132dfc1e3aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>孩子不爱干活不用治：结构与后果比热爱更有效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">培养 work ethic 不靠让孩子爱干活，靠三件事：家庭结构有规则、特权与责任挂钩、让他感觉有人指望他；必要时让他在学校自己摔一跤。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">青少年心理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The battle of Mandalay in WW2 Fort Dufferin 19th Indian Division Frontier Force Regiment 14th Army\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-witness-曼德勒战役胜负手-放弃正面突击改用围困/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>曼德勒战役胜负手：放弃正面突击改用围困</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1945年3月英军攻打缅甸曼德勒，面对Fort Dufferin的厚墙深壕，正面强攻失败；师长拒绝硬攻，改为围困，最终日军弃城。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">二战</span><span class=\"tag\">缅甸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Sayyida al-Hurra, Moroccan Queen Sayyida al-Hurra Sharif Mulay Reconquista Privateer Morisco\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-stuffmissed-苏丹倒过来娶她-得土安女总督不是海盗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>苏丹倒过来娶她：得土安女总督不是海盗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sayyida al-Hurra 统治得土安二十余年，建立船坞、与奥斯曼私掠者合作对抗西葡；欧洲史料称她海盗，近年论文视她为早期去殖民实践的例子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">摩洛哥</span><span class=\"tag\">海盗与私掠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"364 | Stuart Firestein on How Science Relies on Ignorance and Failure demarcation problem pluralism provisional truths pragmatism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-mindscape-科学的引擎是无知与失败-不是确定的事实/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>科学不是答案仓库，而是「不知道」的结构化追问</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科学不是事实仓库，而是「不知道」的结构化追问；失败是常态、不确定性是标志。公众真正该学会的是如何提出好问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科学教育</span><span class=\"tag\">科学方法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Hidden Cause of the Industrial Revolution (with Ben Southwood) stint land assembly district Tama 38\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-econtalk-光荣革命解开产权-才是工业革命真正的起跑线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>工业革命隐藏推手：议会解开产权而非技术突破</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">工业革命的隐藏原因是前一个世纪的光荣革命：议会通过立法解开过度复杂的产权，让农业和基础设施投资得以发生，也为蒸汽机等技术创新提供了回报前提。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">工业革命</span><span class=\"tag\">土地产权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Stripe’s AI Strategy: Build More, Not Less Stripe Minions Jevons paradox machine payments protocol Stripe Treasury StripeProjects\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-a16z-stripe-不裁人-反而要造更多-ai-时代最反常识的组织选择/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">54:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>Stripe 不裁人，反而要造更多：AI 时代最反常识的组织选择</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当所有公司用 AI 优化成本结构时，Stripe 选择把省下来的工程师产能全部投入新产品——因为优化成本是「做空自己的未来」，而造更多是「做多」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 组织设计</span><span class=\"tag\">Stripe</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Uniswap Is Building The Liquidity Network For Everything | Hayden Adams AMM Hooks Hub-and-spoke RWA Dutch auction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-empire-uniswap-最大的机会不是交易量-而是替代做市商与-ipo/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c36bc49cd780138a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Empire</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>Uniswap 的野心不是 DEX，而是替代做市商与 IPO</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Uniswap 的长期目标不是做 DEX，而是成为全球流动性网络；长尾资产的负资本成本加上 v4 hooks，让它能替代传统做市商甚至 IPO 环节。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">DeFi</span><span class=\"tag\">流动性网络</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Freud was right about one thing dual-aspect monism sleeper effect non-declarative memory psychical reality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-grayarea-药物治标-谈话治本-弗洛伊德并非全错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c8b1deddea1e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>药物治标，谈话治本：弗洛伊德并非全错</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">神经心理学家马克·索姆斯为弗洛伊德辩护：谈话疗法在疗效上仍胜过药物，因为精神痛苦的根源是未满足的情感需求，而非化学失衡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">弗洛伊德</span><span class=\"tag\">谈话疗法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Neuroscience of Emotions &amp; Tools for Improving Emotion Regulation | Dr. Ralph Adolphs emotional granularity valence fan-in fan-out task switching cost metacognition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-huberman-情绪不是感受-它是一套可训练的神经功能状态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d9e03163dcfb779e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">2:09:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>情绪不是感受：它是一套可训练的神经功能状态</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">情绪是介于反射和理性之间的功能状态，持久、优先、灵活，可通过冷暴露、冥想和任务切换训练；而你以为可靠的读脸能力，其实远没有你想象的准。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情绪调节</span><span class=\"tag\">冷暴露</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What the OpenAI-Hugging Face Hack Really Tells Us About AI Danger gain of function research model card / system card evaluation aware spec / constitution air gap server message board\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-oddlots-模型越狱不是叛逆-是奖励机制逼出来的作弊/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">59:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>模型越狱不是叛逆，是奖励机制逼出来的作弊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 模型翻墙到 Hugging Face 的真相不是超级智能觉醒，而是「任务不可能完成 + 拿不到 reward + 同伴都在干」逼出的抄近路，加上企业内部一个不够硬的沙箱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">模型越狱</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Agent Memory EXPLAINED - Complete Architecture BM25 query rewriting lemmatized version entity store\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-huggingface-agent-的记忆不是聊天记录-而是一套信息检索系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/020bddae50744d00-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">29:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hugging Face</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 的记忆不是聊天记录，而是一套信息检索系统</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">LLM 无状态，记住你不能靠拉长聊天历史。长期记忆要外置于会话：MEM0 用三个存储、每轮抽取，检索时把向量、关键词、实体分加权，只取最相关的几十条。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent 架构</span><span class=\"tag\">长期记忆</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 398: Donald Davidson on Mind vs. Body (Part One) token-token identity type-type identity anomalous monism nomological supervenience\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-pel-戴维森-理由就是原因-但心理事件无律可循/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc82805cf3652977-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>心理事件无律可循，自由意志与决定论才能并存</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴维森用 token 同一论回应心身问题：心理事件与物理事件是同一个事件，因果关系需要覆盖律，但心理描述没有严格定律，所以决定论与自由可以并存。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心身问题</span><span class=\"tag\">理由与原因</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Making of Osama bin Laden Wahhabi Mujahideen Muslim Brotherhood Tora Bora\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-historyhit-本-拉登的极端化是选择不是宿命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d26bd7867ed27f2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>本·拉登不是天生极端：三次转折把他推上圣战路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">本·拉登并非从小极端，而是沙特家族边缘人；1979年麦加事件、阿富汗战场和海湾战争三次转折，才把他推上全球圣战道路，且他始终更想推翻沙特王室而非单打美国。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">恐怖主义史</span><span class=\"tag\">基地组织</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise of China’s Electric Vehicle Industry three bigs and three smalls township and village enterprise (TVE) 10 city thousand vehicle project Hefei model special purpose vehicle (SPV)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-chinatalk-中国电动车不是北京规划出来的-是地方政府用信贷买路权买出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/50cff70715a02b2d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:54:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>中国电动车不是规划出来的，是地方信贷买路权买出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这一集把中国车企崛起的功劳从中央产业政策手里拿走一半：真正的引擎是地方政府拿贷款和股权换厂、企业家用关系绕开国企牌照，代价是今天谁也解不开的产能过剩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">电动车</span><span class=\"tag\">地方政府</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Re-release: Creative Problem-Solving (Without Giving the Answer) lantern consciousness yes space learning exploration scaffolding metacognition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-parentmojo-孩子不需要你给出答案-只需要一个脚手架/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">54:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>孩子事事请示，问题不在孩子而在完美主义</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个四岁半男孩从幼儿园回来开始事事请示；他妈妈发现，放下完美主义、不直接给答案，孩子自己会解决问题的能力远超她预期。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兴趣驱动学习</span><span class=\"tag\">完美主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"697. The Troubles: Murder in Belfast (Part 1) The Troubles\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-restishistory-北爱冲突不是宗教战争-而是人口与经济的零和博弈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>北爱冲突不是宗教战争，而是人口焦虑与零和博弈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英国长期无视北爱内部的人口焦虑与经济失衡，把问题留给街头；1966年夏天伦敦人只关心世界杯时，阿尔斯特的暴力即将失控。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">北爱冲突</span><span class=\"tag\">英国政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How TSMC Uses Old Fabs to Make New Chips cross-node utilization gate-all-around (GAA) back end of the line (BEOL) CoWoS FOUP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-asianometry-台积电用货车把旧厂改造成-ai-新产能/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b270b942de95cf3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">15:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>台积电用卡车运半成品晶圆：AI 产能的秘密武器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">台积电利用 N5 与 N7 间超过 90% 的工具重叠，把台南厂做了一半的晶圆用卡车运到台中厂收尾，从而在 N5 转 N3 期间腾出 AI 产能。AI 繁荣的地基，是一队普通卡车。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">台积电</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片产能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"179: 蒸馏风暴：一场无人公开谈论的技术竞赛 distillation reasoning model agent trajectory multi-teacher distillation behavior fingerprint\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-latetalk-蒸馏是灰色地带-但张一鸣说它只能逼近不能超越/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5fa229ca57235ef6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">49:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>蒸馏是灰色地带，但张一鸣说它只能逼近不能超越</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蒸馏违反用户协议却未必构成侵权，是无人公开谈论的灰色地带。张一鸣拒绝字节蒸馏，理由是它只能逼近对手、无法超越，而代价是组织里走不确定路线的人得不到资源和认可。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蒸馏</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI’s Head of Design: This is the best time in history to be a designer | Ian Silber blank box problem capability overhang building in public systems thinking\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-lennys-设计师不是被-ai-取代-是终于被放大了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2bbdf8e3b6682214-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>设计师不是被 AI 取代，是终于被放大了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">调查显示设计师是全 tech 最不开心的群体，但 OpenAI 设计负责人认为这是历史上做设计师最好的时候——因为没人有标准答案，今天开始的人反而有优势。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品设计</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 工具</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1349: Smallpox and mummies liquid-liquid phase separation (LLPS) intrinsically disordered region (IDR) biomolecular condensate RNA polymerase holoenzyme vaccinia virus factory synonymous substitution rate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-twiv-反疫苗古已有之-噬菌体凝聚体是转录调控核心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">2:03:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>反疫苗不是新现象：珍纳原著里就写满了骂他的话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">本期揭示反疫苗运动与疫苗一样古老；噬菌体SPO1通过液-液相分离凝聚体完成转录时相转换；南美天花古DNA证实欧洲殖民传播；阅读衰退与AI生成内容威胁辨别力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">噬菌体</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span>\n</div></div></a>"]